OL,3,GNEWSATeenager appears in court on
OL,4,Aterrorism charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has appeared in court
OL,7,Faccused of planning to shoot strangers,
OL,8,Fhijack a car and run over people.
OL,10,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,11,Ffor legal reasons, allegedly hated
OL,12,FBritish people, the Old Bailey was told
OL,13,Fon Friday.
OL,15,FThe prosecution said the defendant,
OL,16,Ffrom Nottingham, had written that after
OL,17,Ftaking a police officer's gun and
OL,18,F"killing a few people", he would
OL,19,Fattempt to "hijack someone's car" and
OL,20,F"run over a few people".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
