OL,3,GNEWSATeenager appears in court on
OL,4,Aterrorism charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing via video link, the teenager
OL,7,Fheard he faces a single charge of
OL,8,Fpreparing a terrorism act on or before
OL,9,F11 September this year. He is due to
OL,10,Fnext appear at court on 29 January.
